  "id": "response-bias",
  "term": "response bias",
  "definition": "In this context, response bias means a tendency for a person’s reports or judgments about bodily signals to be shifted by expectations or other top-down influences rather than matching the signals accurately. It reflects biased perception of internal body sensations.",
